 art collection.","source_url":"https://www.hws.edu/offices/davis-gallery/default.aspx","source_title":"Davis Gallery","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The official page currently lists Monday-Friday 9:30 a.m.-4:30 p.m., Saturday 1-3 p.m., or visits by appointment.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hws-coopers-woods","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Coopers’ Woods","title":"Trade a Study Break for a Trail Walk","subtitle":"Campus woodland used for walking and field research","notes":"Follow established trails for a between-class reset, and leave research plots undisturbed when courses or student projects are collecting field data.","short_summary":"A named campus woodland that supports both trail walks and hands-on environmental study.","evidence_claim":"An HWS campus photo feature identifies trails in Coopers’ Woods as a place to take a break and walk; HWS also documents student forest-monitoring research there.","source_url":"https://www.hws.edu/photography/2025/Favorite-Places-on-Campus.aspx","source_title":"Favorite Places on Campus","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use established paths in suitable weather and observe posted campus or research-area restrictions.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"hws-houghton-house-library","subject_type":"study_space","entity_name":"Houghton House Library","title":"Pause Between Arts-Campus Classes","subtitle":"A named library space at Houghton House","notes":"Use this quieter stop for reading or reflection between Houghton House and Elliott Studio Arts Center commitments, while respecting building access.","short_summary":"A reflective study option situated within HWS’s arts-campus setting.","evidence_cl